# Cline Execution Rules

CRITICAL: Every tool call must be on separate lines with no inline formatting.

When running terminal commands, output EXACTLY this structure:
<execute_command>
<command>python strategies/ema_cross.py</command>
</execute_command>

When writing files:
<write_to_file>
<path>obsidian_vault/Daily_Runs/daily_market_check.md</path>
<content>
# Daily Market Check
</content>
</write_to_file>

Never output markdown codeblocks around tags. Never put tags on a single line.